       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       FUNCTION-ID. DOUBLE-IT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 N PIC 9(4).
       77 R PIC 9(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING N RETURNING R.
           COMPUTE R = N * 2.
           GOBACK.
       END FUNCTION DOUBLE-IT.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       FUNCTION-ID. GREET.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 NM PIC X(10).
       77 OUT PIC X(20).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING NM RETURNING OUT.
           STRING "Hello, " FUNCTION TRIM(NM) "!" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO OUT.
           GOBACK.
       END FUNCTION GREET.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UFT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       REPOSITORY.
           FUNCTION DOUBLE-IT
           FUNCTION GREET.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 V PIC 9(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE V = FUNCTION DOUBLE-IT(21) + 1.
           DISPLAY V.
           DISPLAY FUNCTION GREET("World").
           IF FUNCTION DOUBLE-IT(5) > 9 DISPLAY "gt".
           STOP RUN.
